  "description": " reply by email only.\n\nModern built 'A' rated 2 bed semi detached house (81 sq m).\n\nAccommodation comprises Entrance Hallway, guest w.c. study, fully fitted kitchen with integrated appliances, and living room on the ground floor with doors leading to the garden.  \n\nUpstairs there are two good sized double bedrooms and 1 family bathroom with walk in shower.  There is a separate  spacious guest wc downstairs.\n\nTo the front of the property there is a gravelled drive way with off street parking for 2 cars and a side access to the sun drenched westerly facing rear garden with raised beds, patio area and pergola.\n\nSituated in a quiet cul de sac  off Mounttown Road, Woodlawn Park has a host of amenities on its doorstep  are close including parklands, playgrounds at Cualanor.  Schools, public transport and shopping at Park Pointe are close by and the sea is a short stroll away.\n\nThere is also an electric car point on the side of the house.",
